  "summary": "@servicetitan/va-mfe-loader preinstall drops Bun runtime and executes obfuscated payload",
  "details": "package.json declares a preinstall hook that runs setup.mjs. setup.mjs downloads the Bun runtime v1.3.13 from GitHub releases into a temp directory, marks it executable, and uses it to execFileSync a sibling file math_init.js. math_init.js is a ~727KB single-line heavily obfuscated blob (shuffled string-array rotator, hex-mangled _0xNNNN identifiers) whose name and content bear no relation to the package's advertised purpose (a micro-frontend loader). Executing the payload under a freshly-downloaded alternate runtime is a known evasion pattern that bypasses Node-based scanning of the actual behavior. The harm fires automatically on npm install via the preinstall lifecycle hook.",
